    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is proud to present The Mews, Rere of 31 Mount Pleasant Square, Ranelagh, Dublin 6. This distinctive cut-stone mews is superbly positioned to the rear of Mount Pleasant Square in the heart of Ranelagh, offering bright turn-key accommodation of approximately 124 sqm (1,334 sqft) which briefly comprises of an inviting reception hall with guest w.c, off the reception hall there is a comfortable living room with solid fuel fire. From this room there are double doors which lead to a bright dining area, which then leads to a kitchen, both of which feature a glazed atrium overhead ensuring maximum levels of natural light. Off the dining room, is a cosy living room which would also make an ideal home office space. The garage has been cleverly designed as a utility room and offers an abundance of storage solutions. Upstairs, there are three generous bedrooms with the master bedroom benefitting with an ensuite bathroom and a family bathroom completes the accommodation. Outside the rear private low maintenance courtyard garden enjoys both easterly and southerly sunshine. \n\n This home is in immaculate condition throughout, requiring no work, simply move in and enjoy the vibrant village lifestyle that Ranelagh has to offer, with its cafes, boutiques, and LUAS access just moments away. The Mews is exceptionally well located to the rear of 31 Mount Pleasant Square a short stroll to the LUAS at Ranelagh providing easy access to Dublin city centre and south to Dundrum Town Centre and beyond. All of the amenities nearby Ranelagh and Rathmines are a gentle stroll away, there are numerous primary and secondary schools in the immediate area. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a turn-key gem in one of Dublin's most desirable neighbourhoods. \nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Versatile family home or rental potential.</li><li> Residents Parking Permit available on Mount Pleasant Square.</li><li> Secluded sunny courtyard garden</li><li> Turnkey Condition throughout.</li><li> Gas-fired Central Heating</li><li> Spacious Accommodation extending to 124sqm / 1334sqft</li><li> C1 BER Rating.</ul>"
      },
